{start_of_verse}
[Em7]When we were strangers
I watched you from afar[D]_[D/A]_[Dmaj7]_[Dmaj7/A]
[Em7]When we were lovers
I loved you with all my heart[D]_[D/A]_[Dmaj7]_[Dmaj7/A]
{end_of_verse}


{start_of_part: Pre-Chorus}
